%% Buyurtma holatlari mashinasi (order_status)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created
    created --> pending_confirmation: rezerv olindi
    pending_confirmation --> accepted: filial tasdiqladi / avto
    pending_confirmation --> cancelled: rad etildi / vaqt tugadi
    accepted --> preparing: yig'ish boshlandi
    accepted --> cancelled: xaridor bekor qildi
    preparing --> ready: qadoqlandi
    preparing --> cancelled: operator bekor qildi
    ready --> in_delivery: kuryer olib ketdi
    in_delivery --> completed: topshirildi (PoD)
    in_delivery --> cancelled: topshirib bo'lmadi, qaytarildi
    completed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]

    note right of cancelled
        Rezerv bo'shatiladi,
        to'lov bo'lsa refund yaratiladi
    end note
